  "content": "{section: Intro}\n[F] [G] [Bb] [C] [D] [F] [G] [Bb] [C]\n(compasso 7/8)\n\n{section: Verso 1}\n[A]Light green to green, dark green, [C]brown [A]\n[C]Every life is falling [A]down\n[A]Brown to black, it's coming back [C]\n[C]Dies to be part of the [A]ground\n[G]Seed to seedling, root to stem [F] [E] [G#]\n\n{section: Verso 2}\n[A]Eyes, no eyes, there's no [C]difference [A]\n[C]Every life is looking [A]in\n[C]Swallowing seeds on the deathbed [A]\n[G]Dig a hole in,... the garden [F] [E] [G#]\n\n{section: Ponte}\n[C#]Everyone is practicing,...\n[Eb] [E] [G#]\n[C#]But this world's an accident\n[Eb] [E] [G#]\n[C#]I was the fool because I thought [C]\n\n{section: Refrão}\n[D]I thought the [E]world [G]\n[C]Turns out the world [D]thought [E]me [G]\n[C]It's all the other way round [D] [E]\n[G]We're upside down [C] [A]\n\n{section: Solo}\n[A] [C] [A] [C] [A] [C] [A] [C]\n\n{section: Verso 3}\n[A]Daddy's gone up flames,...\n[C] [A]But this ain't no movie\n[A]This ain't no book you can close\n[A]When the big lie hits your eye. [G] [F] [E] [G#]\n\n{section: Ponte 2}\n[C#]Everybody's practicing\n[Eb] [E] [G#]\n[C#]Our world's an accident\n[Eb] [E] [G#]\n[C#]I was the fool because I thought [C]\n\n{section: Refrão 2}\n[D]I thought the [E]world [G] [C] (x2) [A]\n[C]Turns out the world [D]thought [E]me [G] [C]\n[C]It's all the other way [D]round [E] [G]\n[C]We're upside down\n\n{section: Outro}\n[E] [C] [E] [C] [D] [B] [E]\nDown down down let the fluency set it down\n[C] [E] [C] [D] [B] [E]\nLet the fluency set it down\n[C] [E] [C]\n[D] [B]\nThere's an upside of down\n[F] [G] [Bb] [C] [D] (x5)\nThe moon is rolling around"
